  "notes": "FORMS:\n{補|ほ} (supplement, compensate) + {足|そく} (add, suffice) → add to supplement\n{補足|ほそく}する (to supplement, to add)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {補足|ほそく}{説明|せつめい} (supplementary explanation)\n- {補足|ほそく}{情報|じょうほう} (supplementary information)\n- {補足|ほそく}{資料|しりょう} (supplementary materials)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {追加|ついか} (addition)\n- {付|つ}け{足|た}す (to add on)\n- {補|おぎな}う (to supplement, to make up for)\n- {添|そ}える (to add, to attach)\n\nUSAGE:\nCommonly used in meetings, presentations, and written documents when adding clarifying information. The phrase \"{一点|いってん}{補足|ほそく}ですが\" (Just one thing to add...) is frequently heard in business settings.",
